{"path":"utility/program/raise","title":"std::raise","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>raise","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/utility/program/raise","section":"utility","kind":"page","summary":"Sends signal sig to the program. The signal handler (specified using the std::signal() function) is invoked.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/csignal\">&lt;csignal&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> raise<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> sig <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Sends signal sig to the program. The signal handler (specified using the <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/signal\">std::signal()</a></span> function) is invoked.\n</p><p>If the user-defined signal handling strategy is not set using <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/signal\">std::signal()</a></span> yet, it is implementation-defined whether the signal will be ignored or default handler will be invoked. \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td>  sig\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td>  the signal to be sent. It can be an implementation-defined value or one of the following values:\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/SIG_types\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>SIGABRT</span><span>SIGFPE</span><span>SIGILL</span><span>SIGINT</span><span>SIGSEGV</span><span>SIGTERM</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  defines signal types <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(macro constant)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">​<span class=\"nu0\">0</span>​</span></code> upon success, non-zero value on failure.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;csignal&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">void</span> signal_handler<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"kw4\">int</span> signal<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Received signal \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> signal <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// Install a signal handler</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/signal\"><span class=\"kw980\">std::<span class=\"me2\">signal</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/SIG_types\"><span class=\"kw990\">SIGTERM</span></a>, signal_handler<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"Sending signal \"</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/SIG_types\"><span class=\"kw990\">SIGTERM</span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">raise</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/SIG_types\"><span class=\"kw990\">SIGTERM</span></a><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>Sending signal 15\nReceived signal 15</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/utility/program/signal\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>signal</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  sets a signal handler for particular signal <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/program/raise\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>raise</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"utility","title":"Utility library"},{"path":"utility/program","title":"Program support utilities"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::raise","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Sends signal sig to the program. The signal handler (specified using the std::signal() function) is invoked."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"sig","children":[{"label":"SIGABRT, SIGFPE, SIGILL, …","note":"defines signal types"}]},{"label":"Return value","note":"0 upon success, non-zero value on failure."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"signal","note":"sets a signal handler for particular signal"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":150,"codeBlockCount":2}
